message.content:
This is a replacement filter for a household air purifier, so it falls under parts of air filtering machinery in heading 8421. Subheading 8421.39 covers filtering or purifying machinery for gases, and its parts are classified in 8421.99.

Within 8421.99, the options are 8421.99.01 (parts of filtering machinery for gases other than those of subheading 8421.99.0040) and the more specific 8421.99.0040 (the "filter or purifier parts of machinery of 8421.39"). I recall that in HTSUS 8421.99.00 the statistical suffixes are 40 for "Filtering or purifying machinery for gases, other" and 90 for "Other". In CBP rulings, such air purifier replacement filters are classified in 8421.99.0040 (for example, rulings on HEPA filters for air purifiers). I recall that 8421.99.0040 is described as "Parts of machinery of subheadings 8421.21, 8421.22, 8421.29, 8421.39" or similar, which fits. I'll go with 8421.99.0040.

{"hts_code": "8421.99.0040", "reason": "Multi-stage replacement filter cartridges dedicated for household air purifiers are parts of gas filtering/purifying machinery of subheading 8421.39, classified in 8421.99.0040."}
